+**Project Type**: CLI (`apps/cli`, the `graphhelm` binary)
+
+**Performance Goals**: N/A — comment-only, behavior-neutral change
+
+**Constraints**:
+- Comment lines only: no non-comment token, ordering, or formatting may change (FR-006).
+- Documentation remains English (repository documentation-language rule).
+- No doubled blank lines may be introduced and no single separating blank line dropped (edge case).
+- Proof is the smallest adequate observer, per Journey-Proven Development: a per-site adjacency
+  check plus a scoped formatting check — not a workspace-wide build.
+
+**Scale/Scope**: 2 files, 3 relocated documentation blocks, 4 affected items
+(`addressable_scope`, `repository_scope`, `assign_schema`, `synthesize_schema`).
