+## Implementation Strategy
+
+### MVP First (User Story 1 Only)
+
+1. Complete Phase 1: Setup
+2. Complete Phase 2: Foundational (CRITICAL - blocks all stories)
+3. Complete Phase 3: User Story 1 (both relocations + site inspections)
+4. **STOP and VALIDATE**: verify correct ownership at all four items via T008 + T009 (or generated docs via T010) — the value of the feature is fully delivered here
+5. Report; do not proceed to Phase 4 without that checkpoint passing
+
+### Incremental Delivery
+
+1. Complete Setup + Foundational → anchors and block identities fixed
+2. Add User Story 1 → inspect independently → MVP delivered (docs restored)
+3. Add User Story 2 → prove independently (byte-scoped diff + scoped fmt) → minimality evidenced
+4. Polish → checklist walk + delivery record
+5. Each story adds value without touching what the previous story proved
+
+### Proof Discipline (from plan.md and AGENTS.md)
+
+- The smallest adequate observers are T008/T009 (adjacency), T011 (byte-scoped diff), T012 (scoped fmt) — the workspace test suite and `ci/gate.ps1` remain a backstop only (SC-004) and are never the primary proof for this comment-only change
+- No rewording anywhere: every relocated line must match the pre-fix bytes (checked by T011's multiset assertion)
